---
import Headline from "../ui/Headline.astro";
import Section from "../ui/Section.astro";
---

<Section>
  <Headline id="history" title="Celebrating 25 Years of EuroPython" center={true} />

  <div class="mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl text-center text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <p>
      In 2026, we celebrate the <strong>25th anniversary</strong> of EuroPython—Europe's longest-running
      community-driven Python conference! Since 2002, from humble beginnings in
      Charleroi, Belgium, EuroPython has brought together thousands of developers,
      enthusiasts, and innovators from around the globe.
    </p>

    <p>
      In 2026, we expect <strong>1,500+ participants</strong>, <strong>100+ speakers</strong>, and <strong>7 days</strong> of talks,
      tutorials, and sprints.
    </p>

  </div>
</Section>
